**If resale or geological origin matters to you:** Buy natural. The [1ct G-VS2 natural radiant at $2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is a GIA-certified, earth-mined diamond with modest resale value and the full origin story. That is a legitimate choice. The trade-off is carat weight and specs per dollar.

